msgstr "从 {branchHead} 发行"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:349
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section describes the general procedures of the FreeBSD release cycle "
"from the {branchHead} branch."
msgstr "本节介绍从 `{branchHead}` 分支进行 FreeBSD 发行的一般流程。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:351
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "FreeBSD \"`ALPHA`\" Builds"
msgstr "FreeBSD“`ALPHA`”构建"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:355
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting with the FreeBSD 10.0-RELEASE cycle, the notion of \"`ALPHA`\" "
"builds was introduced.  Unlike the `BETA` and `RC` builds, `ALPHA` builds "
"are not included in the FreeBSD Release schedule."
msgstr "从 FreeBSD 10.0-RELEASE 发行周期开始，引入了“`ALPHA`”构建的概念。与 `BETA` 和 `RC` 构建不同，`ALPHA` 构建不列入 FreeBSD 发行日程。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:357
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The idea behind `ALPHA` builds is to provide regular FreeBSD-provided builds "
"before the creation of the {branchStable} branch."
msgstr "`ALPHA` 构建旨在于创建 `{branchStable}` 分支之前，定期提供由 FreeBSD 项目构建的版本。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:359
#, fuzzy
msgid "FreeBSD `ALPHA` snapshots should be built approximately once a week."
msgstr "FreeBSD `ALPHA` 快照应大约每周构建一次。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:362
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For the first `ALPHA` build, the `BRANCH` value in [.filename]#sys/conf/"
"newvers.sh# needs to be changed from `CURRENT` to `ALPHA1`.  For subsequent "
"`ALPHA` builds, increment each `ALPHA__N__` value by one."
msgstr "首次 `ALPHA` 构建时，需要将 [.filename]#sys/conf/newvers.sh# 中的 `BRANCH` 值从 `CURRENT` 改为 `ALPHA1`。后续的 `ALPHA` 构建中，每次将 `ALPHA__N__` 的值递增 1。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:364
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"See crossref:freebsd-releng[releng-building, Building FreeBSD Installation "
"Media] for information on building the `ALPHA` images."
msgstr "有关构建 `ALPHA` 镜像的信息，请参见 crossref:freebsd-releng[releng-building, 构建 FreeBSD 安装介质]。"

