#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:669
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Staging FreeBSD Installation Media Images"
msgstr "暂存 FreeBSD 安装介质镜像"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:672
#, fuzzy
msgid "Staging FreeBSD snapshots and releases is a two part process:"
msgstr "暂存 FreeBSD 快照和发行版分为两个步骤："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:674
#, fuzzy
msgid "Creating the directory structure to match the hierarchy on `ftp-master`"
msgstr "创建与 `ftp-master` 上层级结构相匹配的目录结构"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:677
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If `EVERYTHINGISFINE` is defined in the build configuration files, [."
"filename]#main.conf# in the case of the build scripts referenced above, this "
"happens automatically in the man:chroot[8] after the build is complete, "
"creating the directory structure in [.filename]#${DESTDIR}/R/ftp-stage# with "
"a path structure matching what is expected on `ftp-master`.  This is "
"equivalent to running the following in the man:chroot[8] directly:"
msgstr "如果在构建配置文件中定义了 `EVERYTHINGISFINE`（对于上述构建脚本而言即 [.filename]#main.conf#），那么构建完成后会在 man:chroot[8] 中自动执行此操作，在 [.filename]#${DESTDIR}/R/ftp-stage# 中创建符合 `ftp-master` 预期路径结构的目录。这相当于直接在 man:chroot[8] 中运行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:681
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# make -C /usr/src/release -f Makefile.mirrors EVERYTHINGISFINE=1 ftp-stage\n"
msgstr "# make -C /usr/src/release -f Makefile.mirrors EVERYTHINGISFINE=1 ftp-stage\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:684
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After each architecture is built, [.filename]#thermite.sh# will rsync the [."
"filename]#${DESTDIR}/R/ftp-stage# from the build to [.filename]#/snap/ftp/"
"snapshots# or [.filename]#/snap/ftp/releases# on the build host, "
"respectively."
msgstr "每种架构构建完成后，[.filename]#thermite.sh# 会使用 rsync 将构建目录中的 [.filename]#${DESTDIR}/R/ftp-stage# 同步到构建主机上的 [.filename]#/snap/ftp/snapshots# 或 [.filename]#/snap/ftp/releases#，具体取决于构建的是快照还是发行版。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:685
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Copying the files to a staging directory on `ftp-master` before moving the "
"files into [.filename]#pub/# to begin propagation to the Project mirrors"
msgstr "先将文件复制到 `ftp-master` 上的暂存目录，再将文件移入 [.filename]#pub/#，以开始向项目镜像站传播"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:687
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once all builds have finished, [.filename]#/snap/ftp/snapshots#, or [."
"filename]#/snap/ftp/releases# for a release, is polled by `ftp-master` using "
"rsync to [.filename]#/archive/tmp/snapshots# or [.filename]#/archive/tmp/"
"releases#, respectively."
msgstr "所有构建完成后，`ftp-master` 会使用 rsync 轮询 [.filename]#/snap/ftp/snapshots#（发行版则为 [.filename]#/snap/ftp/releases#），并分别将其同步到 [.filename]#/archive/tmp/snapshots# 或 [.filename]#/archive/tmp/releases#。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:691
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On `ftp-master` in the FreeBSD Project infrastructure, this step requires "
"`root` level access, as this step must be executed as the `archive` user."
msgstr "在 FreeBSD Project 基础设施中的 `ftp-master` 上，此步骤需要 `root` 级别的访问权限，因为必须以 `archive` 用户身份执行。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:694
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Publishing FreeBSD Installation Media"
msgstr "发布 FreeBSD 安装介质"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:698
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the images are staged in [.filename]#/archive/tmp/#, they are ready to "
"be made public by putting them in [.filename]#/archive/pub/FreeBSD#.  To "
"reduce propagation time, man:pax[1] is used to create hard links from [."
"filename]#/archive/tmp# to [.filename]#/archive/pub/FreeBSD#."
msgstr "镜像暂存到 [.filename]#/archive/tmp/# 后，即可将其放入 [.filename]#/archive/pub/FreeBSD# 并公开发布。为缩短传播时间，使用 man:pax[1] 在 [.filename]#/archive/tmp# 和 [.filename]#/archive/pub/FreeBSD# 之间创建硬链接。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:702
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For this to be effective, both [.filename]#/archive/tmp# and [.filename]#/"
"archive/pub# must reside on the same logical filesystem."
msgstr "要使此操作生效，[.filename]#/archive/tmp# 和 [.filename]#/archive/pub# 必须位于同一个逻辑文件系统中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:705
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is a caveat, however, where rsync must be used after man:pax[1] to "
"correct the symbolic links in [.filename]#pub/FreeBSD/snapshots/ISO-IMAGES# "
"which man:pax[1] will replace with a hard link, increasing the propagation "
"time."
msgstr "不过有一点需要注意：man:pax[1] 会将 [.filename]#pub/FreeBSD/snapshots/ISO-IMAGES# 中的符号链接替换为硬链接，因此之后必须使用 rsync 修正这些符号链接，这会增加传播时间。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:709
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As with the staging steps, this requires `root` level access, as this step "
"must be executed as the `archive` user."
msgstr "与暂存步骤一样，此步骤需要 `root` 级别的访问权限，因为必须以 `archive` 用户身份执行。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:712
#, fuzzy
msgid "As the `archive` user:"
msgstr "以 `archive` 用户身份执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:718
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% cd /archive/tmp/snapshots\n"
"% pax -r -w -l . /archive/pub/FreeBSD/snapshots\n"
"% /usr/local/bin/rsync -avH /archive/tmp/snapshots/* /archive/pub/FreeBSD/snapshots/\n"
msgstr "% cd /archive/tmp/snapshots\n% pax -r -w -l . /archive/pub/FreeBSD/snapshots\n% /usr/local/bin/rsync -avH /archive/tmp/snapshots/* /archive/pub/FreeBSD/snapshots/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:721
#, fuzzy
msgid "Replace _snapshots_ with _releases_ as appropriate."
msgstr "根据需要，将 __snapshots__ 替换为 __releases__。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:723
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Wrapping up the Release Cycle"
msgstr "结束发行周期"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:726
#, fuzzy
msgid "This section describes general post-release tasks."
msgstr "本节介绍发行后的常规任务。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:728
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Post-Release Errata Notices"
msgstr "发行后勘误通知"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:732
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As the release cycle approaches conclusion, it is common to have several EN "
"(Errata Notice) candidates to address issues that were discovered late in "
"the cycle.  Following the release, the {teamRe} and the {teamSecteam} "
"revisit changes that were not approved prior to the final release, and "
"depending on the scope of the change in question, may issue an EN."
msgstr "随着发行周期接近尾声，通常会有若干 EN（勘误通知）候选项，用于处理周期后期发现的问题。发行后，{teamRe} 和 {teamSecteam} 会重新审查最终发行前未获批准的更改，并根据相关更改的范围决定是否发布 EN。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:736
#, fuzzy
msgid "The actual process of issuing ENs is handled by the {teamSecteam}."
msgstr "EN 的实际发布流程由 {teamSecteam} 负责。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:739
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To request an Errata Notice after a release cycle has completed, a developer "
"should fill out the https://www.freebsd.org/security/errata-template."
"txt[Errata Notice template], in particular the `Background`, `Problem "
"Description`, `Impact`, and if applicable, `Workaround` sections."
msgstr "发行周期结束后，如需申请勘误通知，开发者应填写 link:https://www.freebsd.org/security/errata-template.txt[勘误通知模板]，尤其是 `Background`、`Problem Description`、`Impact`，以及适用时的 `Workaround` 部分。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:741
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The completed Errata Notice template should be emailed together with either "
"a patch against the {branchReleng} branch or a list of revisions from the "
"{branchStable} branch."
msgstr "填写完成的勘误通知模板应通过电子邮件发送，并附上针对 {branchReleng} 分支的补丁，或来自 {branchStable} 分支的修订版本列表。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:745
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For Errata Notice requests immediately following the release, the request "
"should be emailed to both the {teamRe} and the {teamSecteam}.  Once the "
"{branchReleng} branch has been handed over to the {teamSecteam} as described "
"in crossref:freebsd-releng[releng-wrapup-handoff, Handoff to the "
"{teamSecteam}], Errata Notice requests should be sent to the {teamSecteam}."
msgstr "发行后立即提交勘误通知申请时，应将邮件同时发送给 {teamRe} 和 {teamSecteam}。按照 crossref:freebsd-releng[releng-wrapup-handoff, 移交给 {teamSecteam}] 中的说明，将 {branchReleng} 分支移交给 {teamSecteam} 后，勘误通知申请应发送给 {teamSecteam}。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:747
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Handoff to the {teamSecteam}"
msgstr "移交给 {teamSecteam}"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-releng/_index.adoc:750
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Roughly two weeks following the release, the Release Engineer updates the "
"Git repository changing the approver from the Release engineering team to "
"the security officer for the {branchRelengx} branch."
msgstr "发行后约两周，Release Engineer 会更新 Git 仓库，将 {branchRelengx} 分支的审批者从 Release Engineering Team 更改为 Security Officer。"

